2. SQLite (public domain) -- inside go-sqlite3

   go-sqlite3 carries the SQLite amalgamation (sqlite3-binding.c). SQLite's
   authors have dedicated it to the public domain
   (https://www.sqlite.org/copyright.html). No notice is required; it is
   mentioned because it is part of what a cgo build of Gina contains.


3. Go standard library, database/sql (BSD 3-Clause) -- API shape only

